# Pairs with AppRulesSystemOriginOnly. Only system origin may delete an app-owned rule id.
MODULE: AppsRuleDeleteSkipsOriginCheck
TARGET: AppRulesSystemOriginOnly
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the store admits an operator delete of an app-owned rule id
PERTURBS: DeleteAppRule

--- FIND
        Answer(s, pr) == IF ~s THEN "appOwned" ELSE IF pr THEN "removed" ELSE "notFound"
--- REPLACE
        Answer(s, pr) == IF pr THEN "removed" ELSE "notFound"
--- END
